s:\n1. Check the worker/process logs for the signal or timeout that caused the Pi RPC exit and recover any missing original test-generation transcript.\n2. Create the `4.3.1` test project from the existing `3.6.0` suite, adapt it for Kafka Streams 4.3.1, and run `compileTestJava` followed by `javaTest`.\n3. Once JVM tests pass, run the coordinate-scoped metadata/native test and dynamic-access reporting tasks, then generate the missing execution metrics.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01c1cd3808457d5b016a993d6321cc87d2ae34070182139473\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 4682, "output": 1438, "cacheRead": 148736, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1034, "totalTokens": 154856, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1788427594653, "responseId": "resp_01c1cd3808457d5b016a993d4b046087d285a59b1a7acd2f87", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
