 and run coordinate-scoped `compileTestJava` and `javaTest`.\n3. After JVM tests pass, generate and validate metadata, run the native test and dynamic-access report, and record the missing execution metrics.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_033adf6cf3f5eb8d016a99645008cc87d29c2d7729650ce499\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 6684, "output": 1778, "cacheRead": 157824, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1365, "totalTokens": 166286, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1788437554932, "responseId": "resp_033adf6cf3f5eb8d016a996433445c87d29c19be6ff9d2b5c8", "rawStopReason": "completed"}}
